    "description": "swissBUILDINGS3D 2.0 is a vector based dataset which describes buildings as 3D-models with roof geometries and roof overhangs. The high level of detail in all three dimensions, high coverage and the realistic rendering of the building volume bodies make this product a valuable basic dataset for a large range of applications.",
